<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Keep up the song of faith,</l><l>And let your heart be strong,</l><l>For God delights when faith can praise</l><l>Though dark the night and long.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Keep up the song of faith,</l><l>The foe will hear and flee;</l><l>Oh, let not Satan hush your song,</l><l>For praise is victory.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
